{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261123/photo/bkn-20261123001640453-1123_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261123020210\"/><p>太古野豬遭的士撞斃。今日(23日)凌晨零時09分，執法部門接獲有途人報案，指途經康山道目擊有一輛的士撞到一隻野豬後不顧而去，牠奄奄一息倒臥在路面。人員接報到場，經驗查後證實野豬已當場斃命。警員經調查後，正追緝涉案的士調查，事後已通知相關部門安排善後處理。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T18:24:14.501674+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":135,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T16:16:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T18:57:45.818841+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T18:17:43.197320+00:00","content_hash":"b4384d23498d7ea5e2657ba8b7f9b580edfa037000af7708da0a54cd7e052d36","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}